msgid "Identification"
msgstr "识别状态"

msgid "Rules"
msgstr "规则"

msgid "Presets"
msgstr "预设"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Enable"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Disabling removes the iptables chains created by this app"
msgstr "关闭时会清除本插件建立的 iptables 链"

msgid "flow-info connection details"
msgstr "flow-info 连接明细"

msgid "Optional per-connection details on the identification page. Not needed for preset or application rules"
msgstr "识别状态页用的可选连接明细，按预设/应用做规则时不需要"

msgid "nDPI application identification"
msgstr "nDPI 应用识别"

msgid "In-kernel application identification provided by kmod-ipt-ndpi. Rules are translated into iptables mangle rules by /etc/init.d/ndpi."
msgstr "由 kmod-ipt-ndpi 提供的内核态应用识别，规则由 /etc/init.d/ndpi 翻译成 iptables mangle 规则。"

msgid "A preset rule expands into one iptables rule per domain or protocol. --host is a substring match, so bilivideo.com also matches upos-sz-mirrorcos.bilivideo.com"
msgstr "一条预设规则会按域名/协议展开成多条 iptables 规则；--host 是子串匹配，bilivideo.com 也能命中 upos-sz-mirrorcos.bilivideo.com"

msgid "Match type"
msgstr "匹配方式"

msgid "Preset"
msgstr "预设"

msgid "Application"
msgstr "应用"

msgid "Custom domain"
msgstr "自定义域名"

msgid "e.g. BitTorrent"
msgstr "例如 BitTorrent"

msgid "Domain"
msgstr "域名"

msgid "e.g. bilivideo.com"
msgstr "例如 bilivideo.com"

msgid "Hook"
msgstr "挂载点"

msgid "PREROUTING (forwarded traffic)"
msgstr "PREROUTING（转发流量）"

msgid "OUTPUT (local traffic)"
msgstr "OUTPUT（本机发出）"

msgid "POSTROUTING"
msgstr "POSTROUTING"

msgid "Action"
msgstr "动作"

msgid "Set mark"
msgstr "打 mark"

msgid "Drop"
msgstr "丢弃"

msgid "Mark value"
msgstr "mark 值"

msgid "A preset bundles domains and/or nDPI protocols. Rules point at a preset, so one preset change updates every rule using it. Domains are matched as substrings: write bilivideo.com, no scheme and no wildcards"
msgstr "预设 = 一组域名和/或 nDPI 协议。规则指向预设，改预设即对所有使用它的规则生效。域名按子串匹配：写 bilivideo.com 就行，不要写协议头和通配符"

msgid "Protocol"
msgstr "协议"

msgid "e.g. SIP"
msgstr "例如 SIP"

msgid "Hit counters come from the iptables rule counters. They only count packets that reach netfilter before fast-classifier (SFE) takes over a flow, so hits still grow with SFE enabled. A counter of 0 means the rule exists but no matching traffic was seen since the last reload."
msgstr "命中计数来自 iptables 规则计数器，只统计快路径（fast-classifier / SFE）接管之前的包，所以开着 SFE 也会增长。计数为 0 表示规则存在，但上次 reload 之后没匹配到流量。"

msgid "Self-check"
msgstr "自检"

msgid "Domain / application"
msgstr "域名 / 应用"

msgid "Packet count"
msgstr "包数"

msgid "Connection details (optional)"
msgstr "连接明细（可选）"

msgid "Requires flow-info to be enabled on the Settings page. /proc is a dump interface, so reading it clears the returned records; values below cover only the time since the last refresh."
msgstr "需要先在「设置」页打开 flow-info。/proc 是 dump 型接口，读一次内核就清一次，下面只是「自上次刷新以来」的数据。"

msgid "Flow"
msgstr "连接"

msgid "xt_ndpi module"
msgstr "xt_ndpi 模块"

msgid "proc interface"
msgstr "/proc 接口"

msgid "Rules installed"
msgstr "已安装规则"

msgid "Last log"
msgstr "最近日志"

msgid "loaded"
msgstr "已加载"

